From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:19:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Returns: Super Admin confirms per-product credit, safe ledger
 posting, route returns join the queue

- Inspect and replacement-inspect are Super Admin only
- Credit is confirmed per product (reason required when it differs from the worker's door deduction)
- Ledger credit marked in-progress before posting so a retry cannot double-credit
- Stock is applied only after the credit succeeds
- Returns with a replacement awaiting inspection stay in the open list
- New /api/worker/route-returns so route-screen returns reach the same quarantine queue (offline-safe retry)

